abstract: >-
  Pindakaas is a library to transform pseudo-Boolean and
  integer constraints into conjunctive normal form, and to
  efficiently interact with Boolean satisfiability solvers.
keywords:
  - Boolean satisfiability
  - constraint modelling
  - logic
